WEBVTT

00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:22.042
BOUNTY HUNTER – MOROHA

00:00:22.042 --> 00:00:24.333
I guess I'll tell you two the story.

00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:26.708
HALF-DEMON GIRL – TOWA HIGURASHI

00:00:26.833 --> 00:00:28.458
DEMON SLAYER – SETSUNA

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:33.792
This happened three years ago.

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:37.375
I was still a kid who didn't know
my left from my right.

00:00:44.708 --> 00:00:45.583
Moroha.

00:00:45.708 --> 00:00:47.042
MOROHA'S MASTER,
WOLF-DEMON –  YAWARAGI

00:00:47.042 --> 00:00:49.042
What is it, Master?

00:00:49.042 --> 00:00:53.833
Deep within this cave, the crucible of Kodoku
will soon fulfill its vow.

00:00:54.417 --> 00:00:55.958
The crucible of Kodoku?

00:00:56.458 --> 00:00:59.750
It's a spell of Fuko used in Onmyodo.

00:01:00.917 --> 00:01:05.833
Within this cave, there are hundreds
of demons fighting against each other,

00:01:06.083 --> 00:01:11.833
and the last surviving one will become
known as Kodoku, the strongest demon.

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:16.917
And?

00:01:16.917 --> 00:01:19.292
Could it be that you want me to go in there?

00:01:19.542 --> 00:01:23.917
That's right. Go in, throw yourself
into that battle, and survive.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:28.583
If you emerge victorious, as a symbol
of completing your training,

00:01:28.583 --> 00:01:31.250
I'll reward you
with my prized Kurikaramaru.

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:33.667
You'd give me Kurikaramaru?

00:01:34.208 --> 00:01:35.917
It's been three years

00:01:35.917 --> 00:01:39.417
since I was entrusted with you
from the Chief of the Wolf-Demon Tribe.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.875
This will be your last lesson,
and your training will be complete.

00:03:28.583 --> 00:03:29.917
"Double-Edged Moroha"

00:03:44.292 --> 00:03:45.750
I'm at my limit.

00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:47.208
I have to use this.

00:03:48.042 --> 00:03:49.708
<i>I forbid you to use your rouge.</i>

00:03:50.542 --> 00:03:53.875
Why can't I? I'm still just a kid.

00:03:53.875 --> 00:03:58.292
If I'm fighting the Kodoku demons,
then I can't win unless I become Beniyasha.

00:03:58.417 --> 00:03:59.917
It's not about winning.

00:03:59.917 --> 00:04:04.333
It's much more important
to be able to maintain yourself in battle.

00:04:04.667 --> 00:04:09.458
Don't hesitate! You can win,
just use your creative imagination.

00:04:09.875 --> 00:04:12.458
<i>What the heck is creative imagination?</i>

00:04:13.292 --> 00:04:16.750
<i>Do you understand? </i>
<i> You cannot use your rouge.</i>

00:04:17.167 --> 00:04:19.958
All right, all right, Master.

00:04:20.167 --> 00:04:25.583
You're the only one left.
I will be the one to leave this cave.

00:04:27.625 --> 00:04:30.625
Hey! Maybe we could talk about this.

00:04:30.625 --> 00:04:33.875
How about we work together
and get out of this cave, huh?

00:04:34.083 --> 00:04:39.167
You're joking, right? Work together?
And you call yourself a demon?

00:04:39.417 --> 00:04:43.667
Hold on.
I smell human blood from you.

00:04:44.792 --> 00:04:46.333
Yeah, I'm a quarter-demon.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:52.792
What? There's no way a measly quarter-demon
can be fine with all this demon energy.

00:04:53.917 --> 00:04:57.292
That's 'cause I have spirit power
that can purify demon energy.

00:04:57.292 --> 00:04:58.500
Ridiculous.

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:04.042
A quarter-demon with spirit power?!
Why mix an impurity like that into the crucible?

00:05:04.208 --> 00:05:08.750
Hey, demon gambling house bookie,
what's going on?

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:10.917
The Kodoku will get muddy.

00:05:11.292 --> 00:05:14.083
Why don't you shut up about the details?

00:05:14.083 --> 00:05:15.875
Blades of Blood!

00:05:19.875 --> 00:05:21.125
You're wide open.

00:05:28.167 --> 00:05:32.042
Sorry, but I really can't take
much more of this.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:40.458
That's why I said
we should work together.

00:05:46.292 --> 00:05:48.917
You should listen to
people's advice, you know.

00:05:49.833 --> 00:05:52.708
Well, see ya.
Hope you live a good life!

00:05:53.208 --> 00:05:54.458
Hup!

00:05:59.167 --> 00:06:00.833
I somehow won.

00:06:03.042 --> 00:06:06.333
Master? Master Yawaragi?

00:06:09.875 --> 00:06:11.625
You're kidding me, right?

00:06:13.958 --> 00:06:15.167
CORPSE DEALER

00:06:15.167 --> 00:06:19.333
You threw that child
into the crucible of Kodoku?

00:06:19.333 --> 00:06:20.458
CORPSE DEALER
Yes, I did.

00:06:20.458 --> 00:06:22.917
She has a fifty-fifty chance of surviving.

00:06:25.833 --> 00:06:29.792
If you sealed her rouge,
then her chance of winning is...

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:32.542
twenty, maybe ten percent.

00:06:32.542 --> 00:06:33.792
CORPSE DEALER JYUBEI
However, I suppose

00:06:33.792 --> 00:06:35.792
CORPSE DEALER JYUBEI
this would be good training.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:40.958
Moroha is a quarter-demon born
between a half-demon and a human.

00:06:41.167 --> 00:06:42.542
If she were full-demon...

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.958
no matter what crisis came her way,

00:06:45.125 --> 00:06:48.875
she'd be able to keep her heart,
and she'd never lose her sense of self.

00:06:49.625 --> 00:06:51.458
Of course, Moroha is different.

00:06:52.917 --> 00:06:56.292
When she is cornered and
her life is in danger,

00:06:56.292 --> 00:06:59.417
her great demon's blood
will take over, and she'll transform.

00:06:59.667 --> 00:07:04.083
However, just like the meaning of her name,
she's a double-edged sword.

00:07:04.417 --> 00:07:08.583
The more she transforms,
the more her heart will disappear.

00:07:08.583 --> 00:07:11.083
She'll turn into a monster that only fights.

00:07:15.542 --> 00:07:21.458
So that's why you used the rouge
and sealed away her great demon blood.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:26.875
Originally, the seal was something
her mother, Lady Kagome, had applied,

00:07:26.875 --> 00:07:32.250
but I taught her how to dispel the seal
by transforming into Beniyasha.

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:38.000
But that girl has been using the rouge
without knowing about any of this.

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:41.750
Truly troublesome indeed.

00:07:44.125 --> 00:07:45.833
Looks like I won.

00:07:46.625 --> 00:07:48.500
If you could kindly hand that over.

00:07:52.208 --> 00:07:54.042
However, Lady Yawaragi,

00:07:54.042 --> 00:07:57.875
for you to sell off your esteemed pupil
in a gamble for just three ryou...

00:07:58.792 --> 00:08:01.125
In order to train her to
maintain her sense of self,

00:08:01.125 --> 00:08:03.792
I had to put her through
the crucible of Kodoku.

00:08:03.792 --> 00:08:08.042
The only way to do that was to
go through the demon gambling house.

00:08:08.708 --> 00:08:11.167
And now you only have two ryou left.

00:08:12.458 --> 00:08:14.167
I'm in a tough spot.

00:08:14.417 --> 00:08:18.917
I need to get this Armor of the Iron-rat
off of me as soon as possible, too.

00:08:19.375 --> 00:08:21.667
How much more will it cost?

00:08:21.917 --> 00:08:24.292
According to an old armor dealer,

00:08:24.292 --> 00:08:31.000
a blacksmith rat can make a key to remove it,
but it would cost twelve ryou.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:34.625
I see. Then this corpse dealer can...

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:37.542
There you are, you old hag!

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:41.250
Oh, Moroha.
You managed to get out, huh?

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:45.417
Shut up! Why the hell didn't you
wait for me back there?

00:08:45.417 --> 00:08:48.458
Did you seriously sell me off
to the demon gambling house?

00:08:48.458 --> 00:08:52.458
Can you blame me? I needed
seed money to play some sugoroku.

00:08:52.708 --> 00:08:58.042
I've had it with your gambling problem!
Our master-pupil relationship ends today.

00:08:58.042 --> 00:09:01.583
I've finished my training,
so let me have Kurikaramaru.

00:09:03.542 --> 00:09:06.583
Your demon power
hasn't gotten stronger at all.

00:09:06.583 --> 00:09:09.708
You didn't absorb the Kodoku's powers
after defeating it?

00:09:09.708 --> 00:09:12.292
Well, I sure as hell won that battle.

00:09:12.292 --> 00:09:16.833
But who would ever want to absorb powers
from such a gross demon?

00:09:19.458 --> 00:09:23.708
You're pretty amazing to have escaped
from the crucible of Kodoku.

00:09:23.958 --> 00:09:25.167
Hey old man, who're you?

00:09:25.375 --> 00:09:30.583
I'm Corpse Dealer Jyubei.
I deal in demons' bounties.

00:09:30.792 --> 00:09:32.625
Yeah, yeah, whatever.

00:09:32.625 --> 00:09:33.917
Master Yawaragi.

00:09:33.917 --> 00:09:37.917
Wait, we're not master-pupil anymore.
I don't need to be formal.

00:09:37.917 --> 00:09:39.292
Hey, Yawaragi.

00:09:39.292 --> 00:09:42.250
Hand over Kurikaramaru,
or we're gonna have to fight it out!

00:09:42.417 --> 00:09:44.583
Now hold on, child.

00:09:44.583 --> 00:09:50.000
What do you say? Lady Yawaragi,
how about I pay for the child?

00:09:50.667 --> 00:09:51.500
Pay for me?

00:09:51.708 --> 00:09:55.417
For pulling out of the gambling house,
for the Armor of the Iron-rat key,

00:09:55.417 --> 00:09:58.042
and for what you lost
in our sugoroku round.

00:09:58.042 --> 00:10:01.000
How does fifteen ryou sound for all of that?

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:02.250
Sold!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:03.458
W-Wait, sold?

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:07.833
However, please hand
Kurikaramaru over to Moroha.

00:10:09.292 --> 00:10:11.583
That's a sacrifice I'll have to make.

00:10:19.042 --> 00:10:20.250
That's all of it.

00:10:21.458 --> 00:10:23.500
Right. Farewell, Moroha.

00:10:24.458 --> 00:10:26.125
Wait! Hey!

00:10:26.125 --> 00:10:27.250
Moroha.

00:10:28.208 --> 00:10:33.125
As of today, you've been hired for
fifteen ryou to this corpse dealer, Jyubei.

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:36.667
You will return that debt
through bounty hunting.

00:10:37.167 --> 00:10:42.292
What?! Why do I have to be the one to
pay back that money to you?

00:10:42.292 --> 00:10:43.625
You're kidding me, right?

00:10:43.625 --> 00:10:45.917
Would you rather go back to
the gambling house

00:10:45.917 --> 00:10:49.125
and continue to fight in
the crucible of Kodoku forever?

00:10:50.333 --> 00:10:54.833
If you don't want to do that, then make
this bounty hunting trade your business.

00:10:55.833 --> 00:10:57.542
All right, fine, old man.

00:10:57.875 --> 00:10:59.542
It's Mr. Jyubei.

00:11:00.583 --> 00:11:03.250
Fine, Mr. Jyubei.

00:11:07.542 --> 00:11:09.083
It's been three years.

00:11:11.125 --> 00:11:12.417
It's been a while...

00:11:13.417 --> 00:11:14.583
Yawaragi.

00:11:20.333 --> 00:11:22.958
You're still wearing the Armor of the Iron-rat?

00:11:22.958 --> 00:11:25.917
You couldn't find the blacksmith rats?

00:11:26.208 --> 00:11:31.583
Well, it took a long time, but I found
the blacksmith rats' hidden village.

00:11:32.417 --> 00:11:33.833
Then, why?

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:38.125
I found the village,
but everyone had been slaughtered.

00:11:40.083 --> 00:11:41.958
As you know,

00:11:41.958 --> 00:11:46.167
my Armor of the Iron-rat and
your Robe of the Fire-rat were created

00:11:46.167 --> 00:11:49.125
in a blacksmith rats' workshop
deep in the mountains.

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:50.542
However...

00:11:51.875 --> 00:11:53.083
How cruel.

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:02.750
You can't find it?

00:12:03.417 --> 00:12:06.375
ONE OF THE FOUR PERILS – KONTON
Isn't this what you're looking for,

00:12:06.375 --> 00:12:07.375
Yawaragi?

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:10.125
Was this your doing?

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:13.792
Rats are useless creatures
with no discipline.

00:12:13.792 --> 00:12:18.167
I didn't need to kill them,
but I thought I might as well.

00:12:18.792 --> 00:12:19.917
You might as well?

00:12:20.208 --> 00:12:22.542
Oh, that's right.

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:27.292
I hear the Armor of the Iron-rat
you're wearing shrinks as years go by.

00:12:28.083 --> 00:12:31.083
A cursed piece of armor that, in the end,

00:12:31.083 --> 00:12:36.292
shrinks to the size of a rat and
crushes the wearer's body to pieces.

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:39.083
Who are you?

00:12:39.333 --> 00:12:41.917
I serve Lord Kirinmaru.

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:45.417
My name is Konton of the Four Perils.

00:12:46.083 --> 00:12:47.167
Konton.

00:12:47.708 --> 00:12:50.750
However, we are currently Two Perils.

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:54.250
Do you know anything
about the one who defeated

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:58.458
one of the Four Perils, Tokotsu,
and stole the Red Rainbow Pearl from him?

00:12:59.625 --> 00:13:01.750
I think you might be surprised.

00:13:01.958 --> 00:13:05.708
It was Moroha,
your beloved former pupil.

00:13:06.708 --> 00:13:07.583
Moroha?

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:13.125
You can have the key to that armor of yours,
but only in exchange for Moroha's head.

00:13:13.583 --> 00:13:17.875
If you refuse,
I shall break this key right here.

00:13:18.167 --> 00:13:21.375
Why don't you do it yourself? Why ask me?

00:13:23.167 --> 00:13:28.458
I thought I'd offer Tokotsu the entertainment
of a master-pupil showdown.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:35.125
Oh, no. So Konton's showdown is...

00:13:35.375 --> 00:13:36.292
Disgusting.

00:13:36.583 --> 00:13:38.542
I'm fine with that.

00:13:38.542 --> 00:13:42.500
Besides, I don't feel any kind of gratitude
towards you at all.

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:45.208
Let's give them a showdown,
just like they want.

00:13:46.333 --> 00:13:50.000
That's good. And that's why
you were worthy of being my pupil.

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:56.333
No need to help me. This is a fight
between me and Yawaragi.

00:13:56.583 --> 00:13:59.667
I hear you've mastered
the Crimson Dragon Wave.

00:13:59.667 --> 00:14:03.208
But how powerful is it coming from
a quarter-demon like you?

00:14:04.292 --> 00:14:06.125
Why don't I just show you?

00:14:06.417 --> 00:14:08.250
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:14:13.958 --> 00:14:14.958
Moroha.

00:14:15.042 --> 00:14:18.708
She stopped it!
A brute force attack won't work.

00:14:19.792 --> 00:14:22.208
Then try this. Sacred Arrow!

00:14:24.583 --> 00:14:28.875
How ridiculous. With spirit power this weak,
you can barely call it sacred.

00:14:30.583 --> 00:14:32.625
Heavenly Arrow Barrage!

00:14:38.292 --> 00:14:39.292
Take this.

00:14:42.625 --> 00:14:43.792
I'm helping you.

00:14:43.792 --> 00:14:45.083
Yeah, I can't just stand and watch.

00:14:46.042 --> 00:14:49.875
You can't!
This is between me and Yawaragi.

00:14:51.125 --> 00:14:53.042
So you'll begin destroying the lands.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:59.625
You fool! You continue to lose your own heart
because fear overpowers you.

00:14:59.625 --> 00:15:02.792
Didn't I teach you to overcome
that weakness of yours?

00:15:02.792 --> 00:15:05.292
Shut up! This is my power!

00:15:05.792 --> 00:15:09.292
If you're only good for fighting,
then you're a monster, not a demon.

00:15:10.083 --> 00:15:14.792
If you don't carry your fear,
then your body and heart feel no pain.

00:15:15.042 --> 00:15:18.792
You won't be able to understand
your opponent's pain, either.

00:15:19.417 --> 00:15:21.583
A monster like that...

00:15:22.833 --> 00:15:24.667
...has no right to live!

00:15:26.708 --> 00:15:27.708
Moroha!

00:15:27.708 --> 00:15:31.458
Wait, she's trying to
teach Moroha something.

00:15:34.542 --> 00:15:37.292
Go ahead and use your rouge.

00:15:37.417 --> 00:15:41.583
But remember, once you do,
you're nothing but a puppet.

00:15:43.792 --> 00:15:47.125
<i>Without the rouge, </i>
<i>I can't win against Yawaragi.</i>

00:15:47.708 --> 00:15:52.792
A pitiful fool you are. A quarter-demon,
an incomplete existence.

00:15:52.958 --> 00:15:56.292
With you, hope will never see the light of day.

00:15:59.958 --> 00:16:04.375
You haven't changed,
not a single bit since you were little.

00:16:05.583 --> 00:16:06.917
<i>Since I was little...</i>

00:16:07.292 --> 00:16:09.792
<i>Moroha, you cannot use your rouge!</i>

00:16:10.333 --> 00:16:11.375
BIRD OF PARADISE –
WOLF-DEMON TRIBE'S NATURAL ENEMY

00:16:11.375 --> 00:16:12.792
BIRD OF PARADISE –
WOLF-DEMON TRIBE'S NATURAL ENEM<i>Y
She's righ</i>t.

00:16:12.792 --> 00:16:15.042
<i>I haven't changed at all since then.</i>

00:16:22.125 --> 00:16:24.292
Moroha, don't use your rouge!

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:37.625
Moroha.

00:16:39.417 --> 00:16:41.667
Damn, it called its friends.

00:16:41.667 --> 00:16:43.708
Looks like you're in trouble.

00:16:43.708 --> 00:16:44.833
Who're you?

00:16:45.125 --> 00:16:46.333
Just an armor dealer passing by.

00:16:46.333 --> 00:16:47.958
WEASEL MAN
Just an armor dealer passing by.

00:16:47.958 --> 00:16:50.750
I saw that girl wearing
the Robe of the Fire-rat,

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:54.333
so I thought I'd recommend
this Armor of the Iron-rat to you.

00:16:54.333 --> 00:16:57.000
More defense,
<i>and </i>more demon power!

00:16:57.000 --> 00:17:00.333
With this armor,
the Birds of Paradise are nothing!

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:06.208
All you have to do is place this key
in the keyhole on my back here.

00:17:08.792 --> 00:17:12.958
Hurry, hurry.
The armor will mold to fit you perfectly.

00:17:13.583 --> 00:17:15.542
Needs must, I guess.

00:17:15.875 --> 00:17:17.208
Thanks for your business.

00:17:24.042 --> 00:17:25.083
What is...

00:17:25.583 --> 00:17:29.667
Oh thank goodness.
My body was about to be crushed.

00:17:29.667 --> 00:17:30.542
What's going on?

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:38.125
You'll have to pay a handsome sum and
get a new key made to take off that armor.

00:17:38.125 --> 00:17:43.542
And make sure you have someone else unlock it,
like how you did just now!

00:17:43.542 --> 00:17:45.417
It was cursed armor?

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:55.917
My power's surging.
It's the armor, huh?

00:17:56.375 --> 00:17:59.083
Scattering Winds!

00:18:08.417 --> 00:18:09.458
<i>That's right.</i>

00:18:10.083 --> 00:18:14.083
<i>The armor, the scars on her face... </i>
<i>they're all because of me.</i>

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:19.583
Your Scattering Winds
was really cool.

00:18:19.792 --> 00:18:22.917
I see, were you recalling that moment?

00:18:23.042 --> 00:18:24.583
I won't use the rouge.

00:18:25.417 --> 00:18:28.208
Defeating you by
letting the demon take over

00:18:28.208 --> 00:18:30.292
won't actually mean that I beat you.

00:18:32.042 --> 00:18:35.333
Well said. Let's move on to
the last stage, Moroha!

00:18:36.125 --> 00:18:36.958
Last stage?

00:18:37.292 --> 00:18:40.833
I'm going to use my Scattering Winds.
Are you ready?

00:18:43.458 --> 00:18:48.208
I'll thoroughly enjoy the moment
you kill your pupil with your own hands...

00:18:48.292 --> 00:18:51.583
Then, this key will be all yours.

00:18:53.833 --> 00:18:55.708
Oh, you'll enjoy it all right.

00:19:01.125 --> 00:19:02.333
Go ahead and do it!

00:19:02.583 --> 00:19:07.208
Moroha, this is the end.
Put everything you have into this moment.

00:19:07.583 --> 00:19:08.708
All right, I'll try!

00:19:09.667 --> 00:19:10.792
This is it.

00:19:11.292 --> 00:19:13.542
Scattering Winds!

00:19:15.125 --> 00:19:19.875
<i>Don't hesitate! You can win, </i>
<i>just use your creative imagination.</i>

00:19:24.042 --> 00:19:25.250
What's happening?

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:32.500
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:19:34.542 --> 00:19:36.000
<i>Well done, Moroha.</i>

00:19:37.667 --> 00:19:38.667
What are you...

00:19:38.667 --> 00:19:41.917
This is the end of the master-pupil
showdown you wanted.

00:19:41.917 --> 00:19:44.042
Feel it with your flesh.

00:19:44.417 --> 00:19:45.667
You fool.

00:19:51.583 --> 00:19:52.417
What?

00:19:56.625 --> 00:19:58.208
Yawaragi!

00:20:01.125 --> 00:20:05.292
The Blue Rainbow Pearl was helpful.
As for this...

00:20:07.333 --> 00:20:09.375
Damn you. Scourge of Swallows!

00:20:09.625 --> 00:20:12.375
We'll meet again, half-demons.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:14.083
He got away.

00:20:14.208 --> 00:20:15.958
Another strange spell.

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:19.375
Master Yawaragi.

00:20:20.292 --> 00:20:22.500
Well done, Moroha.

00:20:22.958 --> 00:20:26.167
That was the Crimson Backlash Wave.

00:20:27.042 --> 00:20:31.958
If I've taught you that,
then I have no more regrets.

00:20:32.042 --> 00:20:33.417
Master Yawaragi!

00:20:35.125 --> 00:20:39.917
Have strength in your heart, Moroha...

00:20:41.375 --> 00:20:42.917
Master Yawaragi!

00:20:44.375 --> 00:20:45.417
No...

00:20:45.875 --> 00:20:47.292
Master Yawaragi...

00:20:50.917 --> 00:20:54.500
Master!

00:21:02.083 --> 00:21:03.792
I wonder who I am.

00:21:06.083 --> 00:21:10.708
I'm not a demon. I'm not a human.
I'm not even a half-demon.

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:14.583
There was no place for me,
and I had nowhere to go.

00:21:15.542 --> 00:21:19.000
That's why I always ran around by myself

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:22.250
and went about making all sorts of noise.

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:25.375
I didn't know any other way to live.

00:21:26.125 --> 00:21:30.417
I feel like it's pure luck
that I've survived up to this point.

00:21:30.958 --> 00:21:34.458
And I have to keep living as
an incomplete quarter-demon.

00:21:34.917 --> 00:21:36.500
You might be right.

00:21:38.458 --> 00:21:41.750
However, you can always
change the way you live.

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:46.625
No matter what you do,
how you want to live is up to you.

00:21:49.458 --> 00:21:50.542
I guess so.

00:21:51.208 --> 00:21:55.958
Come on, cheer up, Moroha.
None of us are alone anymore, right?

00:21:57.667 --> 00:21:58.500
Yeah.

00:22:00.375 --> 00:22:01.375
<i>That's right.</i>

00:22:01.958 --> 00:22:05.500
<i>Somehow, before I knew it, </i>
<i>these two were by my side.</i>

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:07.167
<i>So...</i>

00:22:08.083 --> 00:22:11.292
<i>this is okay, right, Master Yawaragi?</i>

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:44.333
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:44.333 --> 00:23:48.625
We set off to slay Totetsu, the demon
who's been eating virtuous monks.

00:23:48.625 --> 00:23:51.417
But we end up falling into Konton's trap!

00:23:51.417 --> 00:23:53.875
Towa, cut me with your katana.

00:23:53.875 --> 00:23:56.083
What? Why? I can't do that!

00:23:56.083 --> 00:23:59.917
How deep does this valley go?
What's going on?!

00:23:59.917 --> 00:24:03.458
Enter through the gate of opening,
and end at the gate of death.

00:24:03.833 --> 00:24:06.750
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon</i>:
"Trap of the Two Perils"

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:23.979
Shall I steal the Rainbow Pearls
from the Half-Demon Princesses? Stay tuned!
